  unitName: Ice King Jaegar
  unitId: 20223
  unitNumber: 582
  description: A young general from the Sama Kingdom. To protect the women, he held
    his position at a great ice fort that would later become the ruins left behind
    by the great war against the gods. Afterwards, when the Savat People continued
    fighting in numerous battles, he tried to serve as their reinforcement and got
    his right eye injured by the enemy in the process. It is said that he confessed
    his love for Selena, the tribe chief who nursed him back to health, by stating
    that he wanted to convey his true feelings for her before he died. However, his
    life was not truly in danger at the time, so no one knows how sincere his words
    truly were.
  summonDesc: Hey, Summoner, I wanna suggest something.<br>Choose beautiful women
    only to fight by my side.<br> I'm counting on ya!
  fusionDesc: So, which one of these girls is yours?<br>Maybe we could...<br>Whoa!
    Don't get so angry!
  evoDesc: I shall protect all of the beautiful women in this world!<br>I swear it
    by my lost eye!
